Cell["\<\
P2LSimp and P2PMSimp are the explicit regulator-free closed forms used in the \
primary Triangle result. The finite-regulator definitions above are retained \
only for cross-checks.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ca23adc0-9a9d-b740-8386-1b78475654fd"],

